    "text": "Democrats didn't \"create\" MSNBC or CNN any more than Republicans \"created\" Breitbart or Fox. None of these for-profit networks receive government money - other than for ads in campaign season, from candidates from both parties.\nThe bias you see, is because these for-profit companies operate in the way they were designed to: turning a profit. It's more profitable to cater to the preferences of an audience than to simply report facts.",
